    "text": "plaintiff has failed to prove the alleged cause of action and dismissed the plaintiffs case. In order to come to this conclusion the learned ADJ has carefully analyzed the evidence given by the witnesses who testified on behalf of both parties and come to the conclusion that the five pieces of gold plates produced at the trial had been imported into this country without lawful means and in fact been stolen by certain employees of the Air Port and finally sold them to Murugesu. The learned ADJ further held that on behalf of the plaintiff the purchase price has been fully paid, even though on behalf of the plaintiff it was sought to establish that the payment made by way of cheques to the customers had been stopped. The learned ADJ has further come to the conclusion that the fine imposed on Murugesu was not excessive and had accepted the reasoning of the Customs Officer who explained the basis on which the fine was imposed.",
